<title>USA: Lifetime Hoan sets 10 pct stock dividend.</title>
<headline>Lifetime Hoan sets 10 pct stock dividend.</headline>
<dateline>WESTBURY, N.Y. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lifetime Hoan Corp said on Wednesday that it has declared a 10 percent stock dividend to shareholders of record on February 18, 1997, payable February 26, 1997.</p>
<p>As of September 30, 1996, the company had about 11.5 million shares outstanding. A more recent figure was not immediately available.</p>
